    "x1": 488,
    "y1": 1489
   },
   "text": "MR. OSWALD GARRISON VILLARD :\nI left New York Tuesday night, May\n16. On Thursday night, May 18,\nGraham had been released from jail\nwithout a resort to legal proceedings\nbeing necessary and was on his way to\nhis home in Lakewood.",
